abstract: >-
  Mechanistic influenza forecasting for CDC FluSight: an SIHRS model in BNGL
  fitted with PyBNF (sequential particle filter and adaptive MCMC) on the
  bngsim engine, with an operations console, reproducible run ledger, and
  hubverse-format submissions.
